{"suttaId":"tha-ap433","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[538,576],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"tha-ap433:0.3":"Ekavihārikattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap433:1.1":"“Imamhi bhaddake kappe, brahmabandhu mahāyaso;","tha-ap433:1.3":"Kassapo nāma gottena, uppajji vadataṃ varo.","tha-ap433:2.1":"“Nippapañco nirālambo, ākāsasamamānaso;","tha-ap433:2.3":"Suññatābahulo tādī, animittarato vasī.","tha-ap433:3.1":"“Asaṅgacitto nikleso [nillepo (syā. ka.)], asaṃsaṭṭho kule gaṇe;","tha-ap433:3.3":"Mahākāruṇiko vīro, vinayopāyakovido.","tha-ap433:4.1":"“Uyyutto parakiccesu, vinayanto sadevake;","tha-ap433:4.3":"Nibbānagamanaṃ maggaṃ, gatiṃ paṅkavisosanaṃ.","tha-ap433:5.1":"“Amataṃ paramassādaṃ, jarāmaccunivāraṇaṃ;","tha-ap433:5.3":"Mahāparisamajjhe so, nisinno lokatārako.","tha-ap433:6.1":"“Karavīkaruto [karavīkarudo (syā. pī. ka.)] nātho, brahmaghoso tathāgato;","tha-ap433:6.3":"Uddharanto mahāduggā, vippanaṭṭhe anāyake.","tha-ap433:7.1":"“Desento virajaṃ dhammaṃ, diṭṭho me lokanāyako;","tha-ap433:7.3":"Tassa dhammaṃ suṇitvāna, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ.","tha-ap433:8.1":"“Pabbajitvā tadāpāhaṃ, cintento jinasāsanaṃ;","tha-ap433:8.3":"Ekakova vane ramme, vasiṃ saṃsaggapīḷito.","tha-ap433:9.1":"“Sakkāyavūpakāso me, hetubhūto mamābhavī [mamāgamī (syā. pī.)];","tha-ap433:9.3":"Manaso vūpakāsassa, saṃsaggabhayadassino.","tha-ap433:10.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","tha-ap433:10.3":"Nāgova bandhanaṃ chetvā, viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap433:11.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi, mama buddhassa santike;","tha-ap433:11.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap433:12.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap433:12.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap433:13.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ekavihāriko thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap433:14.1":"Ekavihārikattherassāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
